# Google Flow

- Clips sirf maujood project **me** ke andar banao. Naya Flow project mat kholo. Primary: `https://flow.google.com/project/1e11e2a3-ffc0-4a2d-ade0-6c54ca3c4e21`.
- Avatar ya awaaz ke liye `@me`, chehre ke liye `@me_photo`. Jis clip mein Kaif dikhe, dono saath likho: `@me @me_photo`.
- Consistency: `flow-prompts.md` ki `CHARACTER:` line har Kaif wale scene mein word-for-word copy. Chehra apne shabdon mein describe mat karo, sirf "same face as @me_photo". Ek episode ek outfit. Generate ke baad chehra `me_photo` se milao, na mile to dobara.
- `@me` ya `@me_photo` na dikhe to pehle add karo, phir generate karo.
- Kaif ka chehra aur awaaz sirf is channel par. Kisi aur insaan ke saath mat milao.
- Login ya password khud mat bharo. Account pehle se login hai.
- Credit khatam ho to `newpub222@gmail.com` par switch karo. Wahan bhi project **me** hai, aur usme bhi `@me` aur `@me_photo` hone chahiye. Na hon to add karo. Top-up mat karo jab tak Kaif na bole.
- Flow ka audio mute. Screen text edit ke overlay mein aata hai, Flow se mat likhwao.
- Download naam: `raw-clips/epNNN_01.mp4`, `epNNN_02.mp4`, ...
